Pilot: You neglect to mention that 17 of those 20 collisions occurred within the past 2 years, and that the number of birds in the refuge is rapidly increasing. As the number of collisions between birds and airplanes increases, so does the likelihood that at least one such collision will result in passenger injuries.$pilot$ AND q.prompt=$pilot$The pilot counters the conservationist by$pilot$ AND q.correct_choice=$pilot$A$pilot$) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question changed: PT110-S2-Q8'; END IF; END $guard$;
